.TH DCC-GUI 1 2026-11-22 "Dudes Control Center @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.nh
.SH NAME
dcc-gui \- desktop application of Dudes Control Center
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dcc-gui
.RB [ \-\-debug ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dcc-gui
is the GTK3 front end for the fan, CPU and keyboard daemons.
It runs as the desktop user and talks to the daemons over their sockets, so
the user must be a member of the group
.BR dudes-control-center .
Only one instance runs at a time; a second start exits with status 1 (open the
running one from its tray icon).
Closing the window hides it; the application keeps running in the tray until
.B Exit
is chosen in the tray menu.
.SS Tabs
.TP
.B Status
Temperatures, fan speeds, CPU frequencies and the active fan, CPU and
keyboard profiles.
.TP
.B Fan
Fan curves (temperature to fan speed) with a graph, fixed speeds in 10\~% steps
and automatic mode.
.TP
.B CPU
Governor, per-core frequency profiles and the hard frequency limit.
.TP
.B Keyboard
Keyboard profiles with a base color and named zones, edited on a picture of
the keyboard (click or drag to select keys), brightness, on/off and the LED
wizard that maps keys to LEDs.
.TP
.B Settings
Language, appearance (system, dark, light), keyboard layout, and switching
the fan, CPU or keyboard part on or off (asks for the administrator password,
see
.BR dcc-component (8)).
.TP
.B Logs
The daemon and GUI logs.
.TP
.B About
Version and credits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Write debug messages to the GUI log.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 after
.B Exit
in the tray menu, 1 if another instance is already running.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE ", " LANG
Used for the interface language when the Settings tab is set to the system
language.
Available: English, German, Spanish, Japanese, Korean, British English.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dudes-control-center/config.json
GUI settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dudes-control-center/profiles.json
Fan, CPU and keyboard profiles (shared with the daemons).
.TP
.I ~/.config/dudes-control-center/keyboard_led_mapping_<layout>.csv
LED wizard mapping per keyboard layout.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/dudes-control-center/logs/GUI.log
GUI log.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dudes-control-center (7),
.BR dcc-fan-cli (1),
.BR dcc-cpu-cli (1),
.BR dcc-kbd-cli (1),
.BR dcc-component (8)
